# MedSync Health, Inc.
## Net Promoter Score Report
**Q4 2024**

**Document ID**: SALES-012
**Classification**: Internal
**Published**: January 2025

---

## Executive Summary

MedSync achieved an NPS of +48 in Q4 2024, up 3 points from Q3 and 7 points above the SaaS benchmark. Customer loyalty remains strong with 68% promoters and only 8% detractors.

